  "title": "Jubilant Crunchy Polish Vegetable Skillet",
  "description": "A cultured and energizing Polish dish featuring Thai green curry paste, cooked to perfection in a tava griddle, this recipe is a unique blend of flavors and textures. It is satvik friendly and features crunchy vegetables.",
