  "instructions": [
    "Heat the coconut oil in a tava griddle over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onions and cook until they are translucent.",
    "Add the grated carrots and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced zucchini and bell peppers and cook for an additional 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in the Thai green curry paste and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley and serve hot.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy.",
    "Cooking in a ttukbaegi earthenware cook or tava griddle will enhance the flavor and texture of the dish."
